{
	"title": "what is put in a box is seen by it, at the path it was put at, and by no one else. a process in the box reads the node by that path (not its own path in the host), lists the names a path with more than one name makes, a reader of it that is already running is told when it comes and goes. the node is the same one: a write to it by the host shows in the box",
	"steps": [
